# eslint-snapshot-rule-tester format: v1


Test: gantt-no-unknown-exclude >> invalid >>> docs/rules/gantt-no-unknown-exclude.md incorrect 1
Filename: gantt-no-unknown-exclude-incorrect-1.mmd

Code:
  1 | gantt
  2 |   dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  3 |   excludes weekend
    |            ^~~~~~~ [1]
  4 |   Design :2024-01-05, 3d
  5 |

Output:
  1 | gantt
  2 |   dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  3 |   excludes weekends
  4 |   Design :2024-01-05, 3d
  5 |

[1] mermaid.js leaves out no day for `weekend`: it is neither `weekends` nor the name of a day, and it has no digit to be a date.
---


